  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Safeguarding Sexual Reproductive Health and Rights in Nepal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building an enabling policy environment for sexual and reproductive health and rights (SRHR) and capacities for the delivery and institutionalization of resilient, high-quality human-rights based SRHR information and services for vulnerable women and girls, particularly adolescents, youth (AY), person with disabilities and the those furthest left behind at the national level and in underserved municipalities in Madhesh Pradesh and Sudurpaschim provinces.</narrative>
  </description>
